ass="panel_button" href="/login" data-register_action="header">Log in</a><a data-label="register" class="panel_button register_button" href="/register" data-register_action="header">Register</a></div></div><div class="header_dropdown" data-target="browse"><a href="/games/store">Indie game store</a><a href="/games/free">Free games</a><a href="/games/fun">Fun games</a><a href="/games/tag-horror">Horror games</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tools">Game development</a><a href="/game-assets">Assets</a><a href="/comics">Comics</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/sales">Sales</a><a href="/bundles">Bundles</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/jobs">Jobs</a><div class="divider"></div><a href="/tags">Tags</a><a href="/game-development/engines">Game Engines</a></div></div><div class="jam_page_wrap" id="wrapper"><div class="view_jam_page view_jam_base_page page_widget base_widget view_jam_default after_voting is_over has_banner" id="view_jam_1147921"><div class="jam_banner_outer"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NDE3MDE0LnBuZw==/original/VY8ucL.png" class="jam_banner "/></div><div class="jam_body"><div class="jam_header_widget base_widget" id="jam_header_1334345"><div class="header_inner"><div class="header_columns"><div class="title_colum"><h1 class="jam_title_header"><a href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight">Mini Guy Music Fight!</a></h1><div class="jam_host_header">Hosted by <a href="https://brainlessdev.itch.io">Brainless.</a></div></div><div class="stats_container"><div class="stat_box"><a href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight/entries"><div class="stat_value">157</div><div class="stat_label">Entries</div></a></div><div class="stat_box"><div class="stat_value">2,050</div><div class="stat_label">Ratings</div></div></div></div><div class="header_tabs"><a data-label="tab_view_jam" class="header_tab active" href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight">Overview</a><a data-label="tab_view_jam_entries" class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight/entries">Submissions</a><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight/results">Results</a><div class="tab_group"><a class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight/community">Community</a><span class="community_activity">12</span></div><a data-label="tab_view_jam_feed" class="header_tab" href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight/feed">Submission feed</a></div></div></div><div class="submitter_outer"><div class="jam_submitter_widget base_widget after_voting is_over" id="jam_submitter_6089130"><p>This jam is now over. It ran from <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-16 18:00:00</span> to <span class="date_format" data-format="MMMM Do YYYY [at] h:mm A">2026-07-24 03:59:59</span>. <a href="/jam/mini-guy-music-fight/results">View results</a></p></div></div><div class="jam_content user_formatted"><h1 class="text-center">Welcome to the&nbsp;Mini Guy Music Fight!</h1>
<p class="text-justify">This is a one week event where you will be tasked to&nbsp;make a song following a specific theme!</p>
<p>The theme will be releasing on <u><strong>July 16th at 2:00pm EST</strong></u>, and you&#x27;ll have <strong>ONE WEEK</strong> to make a song before the deadline!</p>
<p><strong>Also, don&#x27;t worry if you&#x27;re a beginner!</strong>&nbsp;Anyone is welcome to join, no matter what skill level you are!🤩</p>
<p>Good luck on the jam, and I hope you all have fun! ❤️<br></p>
<hr>
<h1><u>Jam Info</u></h1>
<p class="text-justify">The jam submissions will open on <strong><u>July 16th at 2:00pm EST</u></strong> and end on <strong></strong><strong><u>July 23rd at 11:59pm EST</u></strong><strong></strong>. The judging phase will run from&nbsp;<strong><u>July 23rd at 11:59pm EST until&nbsp;July 30th at 2:00pm EST</u></strong>.</p>
<p class="text-justify">Just like last time, there is a nonzero chance that I stream my reaction to some of the songs, so stay tuned for an announcement about that! 👀</p>
<h4>When making the itch page for your songs, you might see that you can only upload the file and require people to download it. BUT, there is a way to make your songs playable directly from your itch page! <a href="https://torcado.itch.io/scritch-editor" target="_blank">One great tool for this is called scritch editor.</a> This makes it way easier for people to listen to your stuff since they can just listen to it directly on your page🤩 (Thank you Yogu for providing me this lovely information)</h4>
<hr>
<h1><u>Rules</u></h1>
<ol><li class="text-justify">Collaborations are allowed.</li><li class="text-justify">You can use any&nbsp;DAW to make your song. AI music is not allowed.</li><li class="text-justify">Try not to make&nbsp;your song excessively long (longer than 8 mins is pushing it unless you have a masterpiece of instrumentation on your hands 😭)</li><li class="text-justify">Multiple songs are allowed, up to&nbsp;a max of 4 submissions.</li><li class="text-justify">Make sure your song is an mp3, wav, flac, or other typical music format that won&#x27;t cause any issues with playback.</li><li class="text-justify">No NSFW or offensive content please. I doubt this will be an issue but it still stands!</li><li class="text-justify">Make sure the song follows the <a target="_blank" href="http://discord.gg/U2vMZ485aW" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Discord</a> server’s rules.</li></ol>
<p><br></p>
<hr>
<p>
</p>
<h1><u>Judging</u></h1>
<p class="text-justify"><strong><u>Connection to theme</u></strong> - How closely did the song match the jam&#x27;s theme?
</p>
<p class="text-justify"><strong><u>Production&nbsp;</u></strong>- Quality of the song in terms of production (sound, mixing, etc.)</p>
<p class="text-justify"><strong><u>Overall Enjoyment&nbsp;</u></strong>- Was the song&nbsp;enjoyable and fun to listen to?</p>
<hr>
<h1><u>Theme</u></h1>
<p class="text-center">The theme of the jam is <strong><u>Groovy</u></strong>! Here is the announcement video!</p>
<p></p>
<div class="text-center"><iframe width="500" height="281" src="//www.youtube.com/embed/CZZ-WEbO6Nw" frameborder="0" allowfullscreen=""></iframe></div>
<p></p>
<p></p>
<hr>
<h1><u>Winning</u></h1>
<p>Winners will be receiving the&nbsp;<strong>Brainless Champion role</strong>&nbsp;on the <a target="_blank" href="http://discord.gg/U2vMZ485aW" rel="nofollow noopener" referrerpolicy="origin">Discord</a> server!</p>
<p>As for how winners will be decided:</p>
<p><strong><u>Community</u></strong>
</p>
<p>&nbsp;-&nbsp;The top 3 songs (overall) will be the winners of this jam!
</p>
<p><strong><u>Brainless.’s favorite</u></strong>
</p>
<p>&nbsp;- My favorite song from the jam!</p>
<p><br></p>
<p>
</p>
<hr>
<p class="text-center"><img src="https://img.itch.zone/aW1nLzI4NDE2OTkxLnBuZw==/original/PGUXzB.png" style="max-width: 300px" loading="lazy"></p>
